{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MR FARMBOY</strong> is a <strong>cute farming automation game</strong>. Plant, grow, harvest, raise animals, hire workers, gather, craft, automate, and build a <strong>beautiful farm</strong> for villagers to visit.<br> <br><strong>Gathering</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Chop trees</strong> and <strong>mine rocks</strong> for <strong>resources</strong>.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/Godot_v4.5-dev2_win64_0pSW485KyU-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1746803928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crop Farming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Plant, grow, harvest\u00a0</strong>and <strong>sell crops.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/Godot_v4.5-dev2_win64_k8MjqpE3xY.gif?t=1746803928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Animal Farming</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Raise</strong>\u00a0<strong>animals</strong>,<strong> gather produce </strong>and <strong>sell produce.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/Godot_v4.5-dev2_win64_tRWh9KN8OB.gif?t=1746803928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Farm-Building</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Build</strong> a variety of <strong>buildings</strong> such as <strong>markets</strong>, <strong>houses</strong>, <strong>warehouses</strong>,<strong> coops </strong>and <strong>barns</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/Godot_v4.5-dev2_win64_pWuZmgzAbS.gif?t=1746803928\" /><strong>Automation &amp; Workers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hire <strong>workers</strong> to <strong>automate tasks</strong>, such as <strong>planting</strong>, <strong>harvesting</strong> and <strong>transporting goods</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/Godot_v4.5-dev2_win64_ObqaSEFi7X-ezgif.com-speed.gif?t=1746803928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ever-Growing Automation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Slowly <strong>optimize</strong> and <strong>automate</strong> every aspect of your <strong>farm</strong>. <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/extras/Godot_v4.5-dev2_win64_11gSGLTwK1-ezgif.com-optimize__1_.gif?t=1746803928\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In<strong> collaboration </strong>with\u00a0<strong>kenmi </strong>on itch.io<strong> </strong>and <strong>twitch chat.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2795090?t=1746803928","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2795090?t=1746803928","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/5c17d518c0c19e89a979b505c220947538f04a85/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746803928","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2795090/5c17d518c0c19e89a979b505c220947538f04a85/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746803928","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":2797930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MR FARMBOY</strong> is a <strong>cute farming automation game</strong>. Plant, grow, harvest, raise animals, hire workers, gather, craft, automate, and build a <strong>beautiful farm</strong> for villagers to visit.<br> <br><strong>Gathering</stro